# Zips: the LINE_END Trace between U9 pin 6 and U3 pin 7 is cracked. U3's ENP and ENT (and the ENP
# of U4 and U5) float high, so the line counter counts on every dot instead of once per line.
machine test_pattern
title "Zips"
brief "The grid has turned into ragged stripes, like zips, running down the whole screen; there are no horizontal lines."
fault crack U9.6 U3.7 50%
